VISUAL: An animated diagram showing a "COMPILER" hexagon connecting to "VEGA-LITE", "ECHARTS", and "CHART.JS" specs.
AUDIO: 'semantic types quarter price rank percentage change over 70 of them. Then a deterministic compiler takes over makes every geometric decision and emits a real Vega light echarts or charjs'

[01:31] [scene:talk]
